{{!
    @template format_aicourse/chatbox_loading

    The "the tutor is composing an answer" bubble in the AI Tutor conversation. Rendered
    client-side by format_aicourse/chatbox while a question is in flight and removed again when
    the answer (or an error) arrives.

    The animated dots are purely decorative and are hidden from assistive technology; a visually
    hidden role="status" text carries the same information to screen-reader users. The message
    list itself is switched to aria-busy="true" for the duration by format_aicourse/chatbox.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-ai-loading - marks this bubble as the transient loading state.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * None. The bubble is located by its id, aicourse-ai-loading.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * thinkinglabel string The visually hidden status text, e.g. "Thinking…".

    Example context (json):
    {
        "thinkinglabel": "Thinking…"
    }
}}
<div class="aicourse-ai-message aicourse-ai-message-bot aicourse-ai-loading" id="aicourse-ai-loading"><div class="aicourse-ai-message-content"><span class="aicourse-ai-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div><span class="accesshide" role="status">{{thinkinglabel}}</span></div>
